# Windows batch files: cmd.exe REQUIRES CRLF line endings (LF-only .bat files
# mis-parse multi-line if/for blocks -> "was unexpected at this time" crashes).
# Marked -text so the CRLF bytes are stored AS-IS in the repo: every checkout,
# ZIP export and file copy then delivers CRLF to cmd.exe, regardless of the
# consumer's core.autocrlf setting.
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
